Output site/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1150
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 10
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.2

# Aether — one-line pitch
Type "aether --help"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "aether providers"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "aether models zen"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "aether ask one-line haiku about the terminal"
Enter
Sleep 8s

Type "aether sessions"
Enter
Sleep 2s
